                            {
                                "example_id": "2ae19de3-fae0-4cf1-adf6-ea167b60e756",
                                "sense_id": "0f494d93-6a01-37a8-a2a6-0cf1c2c8cc31",
                                "text": "He was hatted, booted, overcoated, and umbrellaed, as became a person who was about to expose himself to the night and the storm on an errand of charity[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64fa00f9-d5ed-47c2-bebc-3ca5f64a1b8f",
                                "sense_id": "0f494d93-6a01-37a8-a2a6-0cf1c2c8cc31",
                                "text": "The harnessing done, he barked suddenly at the house, and there appeared Millie, hatted and gloved[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "53fd601a-73aa-4da6-a519-8454d7646eb1",
                                "sense_id": "0f494d93-6a01-37a8-a2a6-0cf1c2c8cc31",
                                "text": "There is something about the mere sight of this number-nine-size-hatted man that seldom fails to jerk the beholder from despondency’s depths in times of travail."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29fc9800-7dfa-4f80-a313-edc6bfe0fed2",
                                "sense_id": "0f494d93-6a01-37a8-a2a6-0cf1c2c8cc31",
                                "text": "But then again it’s a red hat, and unless you are a fan of certain red hatted sports teams, I don’t think red hats are really all that cool."
                            }
